# VHS recording for the horizontal Bar gallery
Output examples/vhs/generated/bar-horizontal.gif

Set Theme "Aardvark Blue"
Set Width 829
Set Height 570
Set Padding 30
Set Framerate 25

Hide
Type "target/release/examples/readme bar-horizontal"
Enter
Wait+Screen /Style/
Show
Sleep 1s
Screenshot target/vhs/bar-horizontal.png
Sleep 2s
